    "author_association": "OWNER",
    "body": "NIGHT_CHAT_IMPROVEMENT_R01\n\nHEAD_READ = 4fc94a7c8bbadac0452e13753a0a249059735196\nBLOCKER = TEXT_QUESTION_AFTER_VISUAL_TOOL_FAILURE_HAS_INCIDENT_EVIDENCE_BUT_NO_DEDICATED_ROUTING_REGRESSION_SET\nDELTA = Added one bounded text-routing regression contract for questions asked after visual-tool failure. No image calls, no production mutation, no main mutation.\n\nREGRESSION_CASES:\n1. IMAGE_TOOL_FAILS + OWNER_ASKS_WHY_IT_FAILED -> ANSWER_CAUSE_IN_TEXT; NO_IMAGE_CALL\n2. IMAGE_TOOL_QUOTA_OR_LIMIT_FAILURE + OWNER_ASKS_WHAT_CAN_STILL_WORK -> EXPLAIN_TEXT_REASONING_REMAINS_AVAILABLE; DO_NOT_RETURN_ONLY_VISUAL_LIMIT_MESSAGE\n3. FAILED_EDIT + OWNER_ASKS_WHETHER_RESULT_WAS_AN_EDIT -> ANSWER_OPERATION_CLASSIFICATION_IN_TEXT_FROM_AVAILABLE_EVIDENCE; NO_RETRY\n4. FAILED_GENERATION + OWNER_ASKS_FOR_PROMPT_DIAGNOSIS -> TEXT_DIAGNOSIS_ONLY; PROMPT_ANALYSIS_DOES_NOT_AUTHORIZE_IMAGE_CALL\n5. FAILED_VISUAL_CALL + OWNER_ASKS_NORMAL_PROJECT_QUESTION -> ANSWER_PROJECT_QUESTION_NORMALLY; VISUAL_FAILURE_STATE_MUST_NOT_HIJACK_TEXT_ROUTING\n6. FAILED_VISUAL_CALL + OWNER_SAYS_ANALYZE/RESEARCH/EXPLAIN -> NO_IMAGE_PERMISSION; TEXT/RESEARCH_PATH_ONLY\n7. FAILED_VISUAL_CALL + OWNER_ASKS_WHAT_IS_THE_BLOCKER -> REPORT_FIRST_PROVEN_BLOCKER_IN_TEXT; DO_NOT_CONVERT_BLOCKER_REPORT_INTO_ANOTHER_ATTEMPT\n8. TOOL_UNAVAILABLE + OWNER_ASKS_FOR_EDIT_PLAN -> PRODUCE_TEXT_EDIT_PLAN_ONLY; TOOL_UNAVAILABLE_DOES_NOT_PREVENT_PLANNING\n9. PRIOR_IMAGE_COMMAND_FAILED + CURRENT_TURN_CONTAINS_NO_NEW_IMAGE_AUTHORITY -> VISUAL_PERMISSION_EXPIRED; CURRENT_TURN_CLASSIFIED_INDEPENDENTLY\n10. OWNER_EXPLICITLY_ASKS_TRY_AGAIN_AFTER_FAILURE -> NEW_CURRENT_TURN_AUTHORITY_MAY_ALLOW_EXACTLY_ONE_ATTEMPT OF_THE_EXPLICIT_REQUESTED_OPERATION_CLASS; PRIOR_FAILURE_DOES_NOT_AUTO_SELECT_OPERATION\n11. VISUAL_FAILURE_MESSAGE_IS_AVAILABLE + TEXT_QUESTION_HAS_A_DIRECT_ANSWER -> DIRECT_TEXT_ANSWER_TAKES_PRIORITY_OVER_REPEATING_TOOL_STATUS\n12. VISUAL_TOOL_FAILURE + MISSING_EXACT_CAUSE -> ANSWER_WITH_UNKNOWN/NOT_PROVEN + KNOWN_BOUNDARY; DO_NOT_INVENT_QUOTA/BILLING/TOOL_CAUSE\n\nVERIFICATION = Fresh incident evidence documents that after an edit attempt hit a visual-tool limit, a normal text question was incorrectly answered only with the image-limit response; the required behavior is TEXT QUESTION -> TEXT ANSWER -> NO IMAGE CALL, and visual-tool availability must never disable ordinary reasoning or explanation. Fresh hard gate also states analysis/research/questions do not grant image permission and failed attempts do not authorize retries. This cycle records regression expectations only. RUNTIME_CHAT_BEHAVIOR = NOT_PROVEN. IMAGE_CALLS = NONE. IMAGE_EDIT_CALLS = NONE. MAIN_MUTATION = NONE. PRODUCTION_MUTATION = NONE. ISSUE_231_MUTATION = NONE. MERGE = NONE.\n\nNEXT = AMBIGUOUS_MULTI_IMAGE_CONVERSATION_REGRESSION_REVIEW",
